{"id": "1420259952781430865", "ts": "2025-09-24T04:05:59.897000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "1335889582046314506", "name": "toyboxigaccounts_16292", "global_name": "ToyBox | IG Accounts", "bot": false}, "content": "Warmup and proxies are important for TikTok. It will be even better to have a separate Simcard per device, but proxies are still very good; just make sure to use a good app to route the proxy through the device.", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": [], "mentions": ["pwrptcom"], "referenced": "1416150863944224953", "type": 19}
{"id": "1418877703066484746", "ts": "2025-09-20T08:33:25.884000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "662733942184738836", "name": "ejgrowth", "global_name": "EJ", "bot": false}, "content": "I think the best is to add just 1 TT acct per device. First week 20/30 just follow. Then increase it until reach 80/100.", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
