{"id": "1416151339402006590", "ts": "2025-09-12T19:59:50.133000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "1077253600646025357", "name": "pwrptcom", "global_name": "pwrpt", "bot": false}, "content": "also never warm up more then 1 account per device at the same time, once you have an account warmed up and active for at least 2 weeks, then you can go and start warming up a second TT account, I would not do more then 3 TT accs per device on the same TT app", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": ["⭐x1"], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
{"id": "1416150863944224953", "ts": "2025-09-12T19:57:56.775000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "1077253600646025357", "name": "pwrptcom", "global_name": "pwrpt", "bot": false}, "content": "TikTok definitely requires warm-ups for a few days for any actions you want to do, even with aged accounts, whenever you login into a new device run at least 5 days human behaviour patterns, scroll feed for 10-15mins per day twice, like approx. 5% and leave couple comments after day 3 of the warm ups, also saving and sharing posts increases trust, adding posts to drafts without posting adds to trust as well, do not follow any account on first 2 days, start following 3-10 accounts on days 3, 4 and 5... after 5 days the accounts should be warm, but you need to increase follow actions slowly to reach 50 or more daily", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": ["❤️x1"], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
{"id": "1416025034979541092", "ts": "2025-09-12T11:37:56.812000+00:00", "edited": null, "author": {"id": "610449740705955870", "name": "cornershoot", "global_name": "R", "bot": false}, "content": "Interested once there is a way to get multiple tiktok apps per phone otherwise reach will be killed by logging in multiple accounts of the same type to 1 app I imagine", "attachments": [], "embeds": [], "reactions": [], "mentions": [], "referenced": null, "type": 0}
